sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Authenticated User
    participant Client as Web / Desktop Client
    participant Gateway as API Gateway / Auth Middleware
    participant AccountService as Account & Profile Service
    participant Database as PostgreSQL Database
    participant Redis as Redis Session Cache

    Note over User,Database: Flow A: Self-Service Password Change (Re-Authentication)
    User->>Client: Enters currentPassword and newPassword (min 15 chars)
    Client->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/users/me/change-password { currentPassword, newPassword }
    Gateway->>AccountService: Forward with authenticated session context (userId)
    
    AccountService->>Database: SELECT password_hash FROM users WHERE id = :userId
    AccountService->>AccountService: Verify currentPassword via Argon2id
    alt Current Password Incorrect
        AccountService-->>Gateway: HTTP 401 Unauthorized ("Invalid current password")
        Gateway-->>Client: HTTP 401 Unauthorized
        Client-->>User: Display error message
    else Current Password Valid
        AccountService->>AccountService: Hash newPassword via Argon2id
        AccountService->>Database: UPDATE users SET password_hash = :newHash WHERE id = :userId
        AccountService->>Database: UPDATE sessions SET revoked_at = NOW() WHERE user_id = :userId AND id != :currentSessionId
        AccountService->>Redis: Invalidate other cached sessions
        AccountService-->>Gateway: HTTP 200 OK ("Password updated successfully")
        Gateway-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK
        Client-->>User: Confirm password change; other devices logged out
    end

    Note over User,Database: Flow B: Remote Session Revocation
    User->>Client: Views active devices, clicks "Revoke Session" for Remote Device
    Client->>Gateway: DELETE /api/v1/users/me/sessions/:remoteSessionId
    Gateway->>AccountService: Forward with authenticated userId
    AccountService->>Database: SELECT user_id FROM sessions WHERE id = :remoteSessionId
    alt BOLA Check: Session does not belong to requesting user
        AccountService-->>Gateway: HTTP 404 Not Found / 403 Forbidden
        Gateway-->>Client: Rejection
    else Ownership Verified
        AccountService->>Database: UPDATE sessions SET revoked_at = NOW() WHERE id = :remoteSessionId
        AccountService->>Redis: DEL session:<remoteTokenHash>
        AccountService-->>Gateway: HTTP 200 OK ("Session revoked")
        Gateway-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK
        Client-->>User: Remove device from active list; remote client terminated immediately
    end
